        "Create a realistic 10-second selfie-style influencer video on a busy city street.\n\nA stylish blonde woman in her mid-20s wears trendy sunglasses, a white turtleneck, and a casual leather jacket. She holds the camera at arm's length while walking naturally down the sidewalk, speaking directly to the lens in an energetic but conversational tone.\n\nIt is around lunchtime. The weather is warm, bright, and sunny, with clear midday light reflecting from shop windows and surrounding buildings. She talks about how dramatically the weather has improved since the morning.\n\nStoryboard:\n\n[0s–3s]\nShe walks forward with natural handheld selfie movement, looking directly into the camera with a slightly amused expression. Modern storefronts, pedestrians, and occasional passing cars move naturally through the background.\n\nShe says:\n\"This morning was awful — cold, grey, and miserable.\"\n\nHer speech is casual and spontaneous, with natural blinking, breathing, subtle head movement, and accurate lip synchronization.\n\n[3s–7s]\nShe continues walking. Bright sunlight becomes more noticeable across her face, hair, jacket, and sunglasses. She makes a small natural gesture with her free hand and briefly glances toward the sunny street before looking back into the camera.\n\nShe says:\n\"And now it's lunchtime and the weather has completely changed.\"\n\nThe camera maintains realistic smartphone stabilization with gentle walking bounce and small framing imperfections.\n\n[7s–10s]\nShe smiles more warmly while continuing to walk. A light breeze subtly moves her blonde hair. She looks around at the bright street for a moment and then directly back into the lens.\n\nShe says:\n\"It's warm and sunny now. I'm definitely not complaining.\"\n\nMaintain highly accurate lip synchronization throughout the entire monologue. Her mouth shapes, facial expressions, breathing, head movement, walking rhythm and gestures should naturally correspond to the dialogue.\n\nCamera:\nAuthentic smartphone front-camera selfie footage, arm's-length framing, subtle handheld movement, gentle walking bounce, minor natural framing imperfections, realistic stabilization. Keep her face and upper body clearly visible throughout.\n\nEnvironment:\nActive modern city street at midday, warm clear sunlight, storefronts and glass reflections, occasional pedestrians and passing cars. Background activity remains natural and slightly soft from shallow depth of field and phone-camera movement.\n\nMaintain strict consistency of her facial identity, blonde hairstyle, sunglasses, white turtleneck, leather jacket and body proportions throughout the entire clip.\n\nPrioritize realistic micro-expressions, natural blinking, believable walking motion, subtle hair movement, expressive eyes, realistic jaw and mouth movement, and spontaneous influencer-style delivery.\n\nNo facial morphing, identity changes, distorted hands, stiff walking, exaggerated gestures, unnatural lip movement, lip-sync drift, excessive camera shake, sudden cuts, clothing changes, text, subtitles, logos, or watermarks.\n\nAudio:\nClear foreground dialogue with subtle natural city ambience: distant traffic, footsteps and quiet pedestrian chatter. Her voice remains crisp and dominant. No background music.",
